@Override
public boolean preHandle(HttpServletRequest request, HttpServletResponse response, Object handler) throws Exception {
    String token = request.getHeader("Authorization");
    if (token == null || token.isEmpty()) {
        response.setStatus(HttpServletResponse.SC_UNAUTHORIZED);
        return false;
    }

    try {
        Map<String, Object> claims = JwtUtil.parseToken(token);
        if (claims == null || claims.isEmpty()) {
            response.setStatus(HttpServletResponse.SC_UNAUTHORIZED);
            return false;
        }
        ThreadLocalUtil.set(claims);
        return true;
    } catch (Exception e) {
        response.setStatus(HttpServletResponse.SC_UNAUTHORIZED);
        return false;
    }
}

@RequestMapping(value = "/info")
public Result<User> info() {
    Map<String, Object> map = ThreadLocalUtil.get();
    if (map == null) {
        return Result.error("未授权访问");
    }

    String username = map.get("username").toString();
    User user = userService.findByUsername(username);
    return Result.success(user);
}

@Configuration
public class WebConfig implements WebMvcConfigurer {
    @Override
    public void addInterceptors(InterceptorRegistry registry) {
        registry.addInterceptor(new Logininterceptors())
                .addPathPatterns("/**")
                .excludePathPatterns("/login", "/register"); // 排除不需要拦截的路径
    }
}

@Override
public void afterCompletion(HttpServletRequest request, HttpServletResponse response, Object handler, Exception ex) {
    ThreadLocalUtil.remove();
}

public static void main(String[] args) {
    SpringApplication.run(SpringbootApplication.class, args);
}

public interface ArticleMapper {
    // 确保这里没有 @Select 注解的 listAll 方法
    List<Article> listAll(@Param("categoryId") Integer categoryId, @Param("state") String state);
}

从错误信息来看，问题出在Article类的`state`字段验证上。错误表明：
1. `state`字段不能为空
2. `state`字段的值只能是"草稿"或"已发布"

要解决这个问题，你需要：

1. 确保Article类中的`state`字段有正确的验证注解。应该是这样的：

```java
public class Article {
    // 其他字段...

    @NotEmpty(message = "不能为空")
    @Pattern(regexp = "草稿|已发布", message = "states只能是草稿或者已发布")
    private String state;

    // getter和setter...
}
```

2. 或者在Controller方法中处理这个验证错误：

```java
@PutMapping
public Result updateArticle(@Valid @RequestBody Article article, BindingResult bindingResult) {
    if (bindingResult.hasErrors()) {
        // 处理验证错误
        return Result.error(bindingResult.getFieldError().getDefaultMessage());
    }
    // 正常业务逻辑
    articleService.update(article);
    return Result.success();
}
```

3. 确保前端发送的请求中包含了有效的`state`值（"草稿"或"已发布"），并且不为空。

如果你不想使用验证注解，也可以直接在Controller中手动验证：

```java
@PutMapping
public Result updateArticle(@RequestBody Article article) {
    if (article.getState() == null || article.getState().isEmpty()) {
        return Result.error("state不能为空");
    }
    if (!"草稿".equals(article.getState()) && !"已发布".equals(article.getState())) {
        return Result.error("states只能是草稿或者已发布");
    }
    articleService.update(article);
    return Result.success();
}
```

选择哪种解决方案取决于你的具体需求和项目架构。

