根据错误信息和代码分析，问题出在`ThreadLocalUtil.get()`返回了null，导致后续的`map.get("username")`抛出NullPointerException。这通常发生在拦截器没有正确设置ThreadLocal值或者请求绕过了拦截器。

以下是修复建议：

1. 首先，在拦截器中添加对token为空的检查：
```java
@Override
public boolean preHandle(HttpServletRequest request, HttpServletResponse response, Object handler) throws Exception {
    String token = request.getHeader("Authorization");
    if (token == null || token.isEmpty()) {
        response.setStatus(HttpServletResponse.SC_UNAUTHORIZED);
        return false;
    }

    try {
        Map<String, Object> claims = JwtUtil.parseToken(token);
        if (claims == null || claims.isEmpty()) {
            response.setStatus(HttpServletResponse.SC_UNAUTHORIZED);
            return false;
        }
        ThreadLocalUtil.set(claims);
        return true;
    } catch (Exception e) {
        response.setStatus(HttpServletResponse.SC_UNAUTHORIZED);
        return false;
    }
}
```

2. 在Controller中添加对ThreadLocal值的检查：
```java
@RequestMapping(value = "/info")
public Result<User> info() {
    Map<String, Object> map = ThreadLocalUtil.get();
    if (map == null) {
        return Result.error("未授权访问");
    }

    String username = map.get("username").toString();
    User user = userService.findByUsername(username);
    return Result.success(user);
}
```

3. 确保拦截器已正确注册并应用到所有需要认证的路径：
```java
@Configuration
public class WebConfig implements WebMvcConfigurer {
    @Override
    public void addInterceptors(InterceptorRegistry registry) {
        registry.addInterceptor(new Logininterceptors())
                .addPathPatterns("/**")
                .excludePathPatterns("/login", "/register"); // 排除不需要拦截的路径
    }
}
```

4. 考虑添加`afterCompletion`方法来清理ThreadLocal：
```java
@Override
public void afterCompletion(HttpServletRequest request, HttpServletResponse response, Object handler, Exception ex) {
    ThreadLocalUtil.remove();
}
```

